{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/595914-beast-font","id":595914,"title":"Beast Font","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-19T13:27:56-07:00","id":595914,"title":"Beast Font","content":"This is kind of a weird question, but I'm making some handouts for an upcoming game and I was wondering if anybody can identify the Beast font? You can see it in a couple images on the <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/beast-the-primordial-prestige-edition/description\" target=\"_blank\">kickstarter page</a>. All the font-identification utilities I've tried to use have been zero help so far, so any assistance would be great!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T14:16:21-07:00","id":595965,"title":"","content":"Most professionally published materials of any kind use custom and in-house fonts for things like announcements, titles, chapter headers, and like content. Some games and books go so far as to have multiple custom fonts, extending even to the entirety of the body of the work.<br /> <br /> So while I can't guarantee that this is the case with the fonts displayed on the Beast kickstarter, I would guess it to be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3081-anachronistic-jam","name":"Anachronistic Jam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3081_2.